JAVA - Java Codon Adaptation Tool.

* if Optimizes codon usage of gene - Make sure to fits better in the host Organism.

----> It avoids wanted sequences like.
1. Restriction enzyme sites
2. Rho-independent terminators
3. Prokaryotic Ribosome Binding sites

It Improves protein expression by adapting the gene to the host's preferences.

Applications: It helps in synthetic biology , vaccine design & recombinant protein production.
